# Cursor AI Rules — One Insurance Redesign

You are working on the One Insurance Ecommerce Redesign application.
Always adhere to the following conventions:

1. Brand Tokens:
   - Primary: #006838 (Insurance Green)
   - Secondary: #559e45 (Leaf Green)
   - Surfaces: #fcfdfb (light canvas), #1c1e1e (dark canvas)
   - Input class: .ui-form-field (with outline: 2px solid #006838 on focus)

2. Architecture:
   - Next.js 16 App Router.
   - Dynamic affiliate routes use `src/app/[agent-code]/travel-insurance/`.
   - Backend Route Handlers live under `src/app/api/travel-insurance/`.
   - Global client state is stored in `src/store/travel-insurance-store.ts` via Zustand.

3. Flow Steps:
   - Step 1: `/[agent-code]/travel-insurance` (Landing & Trip form)
   - Step 2: `/[agent-code]/travel-insurance/plans` (Plan catalogue & filter)
   - Step 3: `/[agent-code]/travel-insurance/quote` (Travellers form & quote)
   - Step 4: `/[agent-code]/travel-insurance/review` (Locked proposal review)
   - Step 5: `/[agent-code]/travel-insurance/payment` (Checkout & billing)
   - Step 6: `/[agent-code]/travel-insurance/issuance` (Wait state)
   - Step 7: `/[agent-code]/travel-insurance/policy` (eCOC & Receipt)

4. Read local design guides in `docs/design-specs/` before creating or editing UI components.
